	'you, Darling. Hurry, hurry.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_02797:
	ZH 1:
	'Sure.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_027cf:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance and Lia came out'
	R
	'together onto the balcony.'
	R
	'The cheers grew louder.'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Long live King Rance!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Long live Queen Lia!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Long live!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'The King of Leazaaas!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'The cheers came at them like a'
	R
	'wave.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_02797:
	ZH 1:
	'Ooh. Wow.'
	R
	'I’ve got no idea how many'
	R
	'people there are.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_0285b:
	\L_02807:
	ZH 1:
	'They’re all Leazas citizens'
	R
	'that came to get a look at you.'
	R
	'I believe there are 100,000'
	R
	'people here, alone.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris spoke to Rance from a'
	R
	'place where the people below'
	R
	'couldn’t see her.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	!VAR0516 : 5!
	\L_0285b:
	\L_02807:
	ZH 1:
	'Heeeey there, everyone!'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia waved, and the cheers grew'
	R
	'even bigger.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_02807:
	ZH 1:
	'Now then, the new king’s gonna'
	R
	'introduce himself.'
	R
	'Quiet, everyone.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'When Lia said that into the'
	R
	'mic, the audience became'
	R
	'almost unbelievably quiet.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_027b3:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm, feels good.'
	R
	'It’s nice to have all these'
	R
	'people waiting to hear me'
	R
	'speak.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_02797:
	ZH 1:
	'Ahem.'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m Rance, the new King of'
	R
	'Leazas.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'Long live King Rance!!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Long live Leazas!!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Long live the new king!!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance’s one statement caused'
	R
	'more cheers to rise up.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_027b3:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu, that’s right. I’m your'
	R
	'king. Everyone here works for'
	R
	'me. You’re all my slaves.'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll have to say something to'
	R
	'show them their King’s'
	R
	'greatness. That way they won’t'
	R
	'underestimate me.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_027cf:
	ZH 1:
	'The citizens’ reactions were'
	R
	'making Rance more arrogant.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_02797:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, listen well, ignorant'
	R
	'masses!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'From now on, you work for me!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'You live for me!!'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Then when I order you to die,'
	R
	'you die!! Got it!?'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance’s words caused the'
	R
	'citizens to return to silence.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_02797:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh, but cute girls get special'
	R
	'treatment.'
	R
	'I’ll give them all my love!'
	R
	'Gahahahahaha!!'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'The citizens became even'
	R
	'quieter. The people silently'
	R
	'gazed at their new king with'
	R
	'hate in their eyes.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_0285b:
	\L_02807:
	ZH 1:
	'K-King Rance.'
	R
	'What about the speech I gave'
	R
	'you?'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜smooch＞'
	\L_028bc:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris frantically ran to Rance,'
	R
	'and he scooped her up in one'
	R
	'arm and kissed her on the'
	R
	'cheek.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_02797:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, everything is mine.'
	R
	'Gahahahahahahahahahahahahaha.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_027f9:
	\L_02869:
	\L_0283f:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance’s laugh echoed'
	R
	'throughout the otherwise'
	R
	'silent Leazas Castle.'
	\L_028bc:
	\L_028af:
	\L_027cf:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'The Next Day'
	R
	R
	'Civil war broke out.'
